/*
	ScaleFX - Pass 2
	by Sp00kyFox, 2017-03-01

Filter:	Nearest
Scale:	1x

ScaleFX is an edge interpolation algorithm specialized in pixel art. It was
originally intended as an improvement upon Scale3x but became a new filter in
